OL,3,ADuchy tenants may have to buy farms or
OL,4,Aleave as Prince William plans sell-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans by the Prince of Wales to sell
OL,7,Foff up to 20% of the Duchy of Cornwall
OL,8,Fcould see more tenant farmers across
OL,9,FEngland asked to buy their farms or
OL,10,Fmove out.
OL,12,FUp to 40 farm holdings across Devon,
OL,13,FCornwall, Herefordshire and the
OL,14,FMidlands could be affected by the sale,
OL,15,Faccording to the Tenant Farmers
OL,16,FAssociation (TFA).
OL,18,FLocals say talks over the future of
OL,19,Fnine farms on the Bradninch estate in
OL,20,FDevon have already caused "distress"
OL,21,Ffor some tenants who fear they cannot
OL,22,Fafford to buy.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
