OL,3,ADuchy tenants may have to buy farms or
OL,4,Aleave as Prince William plans sell-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokeswoman said the Duchy could not
OL,7,Fconfirm the total number of tenants
OL,8,Faffected by the ten-year sale plan but
OL,9,Ftold the BBC the estate was "supporting
OL,10,Fthem through the process with care and
OL,11,Frespect".
